It was really sweet, like,

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:20.754 size:84% position:42%
how you guys threw it
in the river like that.

00:00:20.754 --> 00:00:21.621 line:92%
-Yeah, we threw it in the rive

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:23.490 align:start size:94% position:6%
