00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:25.358 align:start size:94% position:6%
But we --
No, it was --

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:27.060 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know,
we did that election video

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:28.061 line:92%
to get out the vote in 2016.

00:00:28.061 --> 00:00:30.630
It turned into this thing that
millions of fans wanted to see

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:31.631 align:start size:94% position:6%
We met with the network,
it happened.

00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:33.967
Who ever knew that we were
