00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:41.241
-Yeah, and you guys all --
And I mean this genuinely.

00:00:41.241 --> 00:00:43.676 align:start size:94% position:6%
You all looked very good
for a group of people

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:46.513 align:start size:94% position:6%
