00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:58.124
You were the musical directo
at, like, a dinner theater

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:59.626 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughing ] Oh, my God.

00:00:59.626 --> 00:01:00.927 align:start size:94% position:6%
How did you know that?
So, yeah,

00:01:00.927 --> 00:01:02.929 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was the music director
at a place called

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:05.131 align:start size:94% position:6%
