00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:09.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my God, I have
7,000 stories, but, uh...

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:13.907 align:start size:94% position:6%
One of them is --
What's one of them, Scotty

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:16.709 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughs ]
There's so many.

00:01:16.709 --> 00:01:17.544 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, yes.
-What's --

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:19.179 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is great.
This is --

00:01:19.179 --> 00:01:20.380 align:start size:94% position:6%
Seth, I'm in the middle
of a story.

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:25.718 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is great.
So, I was sitting at home,

00:01:25.718 --> 00:01:26.686 align:start size:94% position:6%
