Oh, my God.

00:01:26.686 --> 00:01:28.988 align:start size:94% position:6%
I gotta speed this up.
Or, let me start it again.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:31.524 size:84% position:42%
You can cut in, right?
-No, we're not gonna do

00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:33.026 align:start size:94% position:6%
any editing.
This is it.

00:01:33.026 --> 00:01:36.396 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Both laugh ]

00:01:36.396 --> 00:01:38.465 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay. So, really quick.
So, I was the music director

00:01:38.465 --> 00:01:41.267 align:start size:94% position:6%
at Pheasant Run Dinner Theatre
in the suburbs of Chicago,

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:42.602 align:start size:94% position:6%
and one day,
I'm sitting at home --

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:44.871 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is before I got the job
I'm sitting at home,

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:45.939 align:start size:94% position:6%
and my friend,
who's the director there,

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:48.408 size:75% position:38%
she calls, she says,
"Can you come finish

00:01:48.408 --> 00:01:50.276 line:92%
the second act of 'Grease'

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:51.277 size:78% position:39% line:92%
The musical "Grease."

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:52.178 line:92%
I'm like, "What do you mean?

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:54.948 align:start size:94% position:6%
She goes, "The piano playe
has tendinitis

00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:58.017
and carpal tunnel, and she
can't play the second act.

00:01:58.017 --> 00:01:59.886
I'm like, "I don't understan
what you're asking me now.

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:02.155 align:start size:94% position:6%
Are you asking me to come
and sit in front of an audienc

00:02:02.155 --> 00:02:05.425 align:start size:94% position:6%
of 500 people, or whatever
and play --

00:02:05.425 --> 00:02:06.426 line:92%
like, sight-read the music

00:02:06.426 --> 00:02:07.594 line:92%
I've never even seen the music."

00:02:07.594 --> 00:02:08.962 align:start size:94% position:6%
And she's like,
"Yeah, that's what I am asking

00:02:08.962 --> 00:02:11.030 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm holding intermission now
Instead of a 15-minute

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:12.765
intermission, it's gonna b
a 25-minute intermission.

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:13.600 line:92%
How fast can you drive here?

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:16.202
And an idiot -- I'm 21 years
old, 20 years old -- 21 --

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:16.936 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I don't know --

00:02:16.936 --> 00:02:18.438 align:start size:94% position:6%
I go, "I'm doing it.
I'm there."

00:02:18.438 --> 00:02:21.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm driving like a maniac
to this theater.

00:02:21.207 --> 00:02:22.342 align:start size:94% position:6%
I get there.
The audience is like,

00:02:22.342 --> 00:02:23.877 size:81% position:41%
