00:02:26.045 --> 00:02:26.913 line:92%
who I have never even met.

00:02:26.913 --> 00:02:29.082 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like, "Hi. Ready?
Two, three, four, and go."

00:02:29.082 --> 00:02:32.585
And I'm reading this music
that I've never seen befor

00:02:32.585 --> 00:02:33.353 line:92%
and missing all the notes,

00:02:33.353 --> 00:02:35.889 align:start size:94% position:6%
and everybody who's onstage is
you know...

00:02:35.889 --> 00:02:36.923 line:92%
♪♪ Go, Greased Lightnin' ♪♪

00:02:36.923 --> 00:02:38.191 line:92%
And they're looking at me like

00:02:38.191 --> 00:02:39.592 align:start size:94% position:6%
