00:02:42.862 --> 00:02:45.565 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I love that you just embraced
the idea of doing it.

00:02:45.565 --> 00:02:47.000 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's what you do
when you're young and dumb

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.234
